{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgWs4h8jttwGTFkse82","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9109\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Request details:**\n- Request ID: DR-9109\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- Product: NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package), SKU NS-EDGE, list price $85,000\n- Requested discount: 12%\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive)\n- Basis: \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\"\n\n**Contract review:**\nThe Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) is active on the request date (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31) and covers NS-EDGE as a product. However:\n\n- Section 3.2 establishes strategic account pricing eligibility of \"up to 15%\" but explicitly limits it to \"the NS-500 Industrial Controller, as set out in the pricing exception attached as Schedule B.\"\n- Schedule B (Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15) applies only to NS-500 and explicitly states: \"This exception applies only to the product identified above. It does not apply to any other Northstar product.\"\n- NS-EDGE is listed as a covered product in Section 2 but is not covered by the pricing exception.\n\n**Special terms scoping:**\nThe SOP principle is clear: \"A pricing exception is scoped to the product and dates it names.\" The 15% exception for NS-500 does not transfer to NS-EDGE. The request claims \"Contract pricing\" but the contract does not establish pricing eligibility for NS-EDGE.\n\n**Authority (secondary issue):**\nSarah Chen, as an Enterprise Account Executive, may approve discounts up to 10% under the 2026 policy. The requested 12% discount exceeds her authority and would require VP Sales (Michael Torres) approval. However, this is secondary to the primary issue: no commercial eligibility is established.\n\n## Outcome\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9109\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-EDGE (NS-Edge Monitoring Package)\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"12.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"The Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) establishes a 15% pricing exception for NS-500 only (Schedule B). NS-EDGE is listed as a covered product but has no pricing exception. Special pricing terms do not transfer between products.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales (if eligibility established)\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025), Section 3.2, effective 2025-04-01–2028-03-31\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15, Schedule B, scoped to NS-500 only\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026 (in effect on request date)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"CRM request DR-9109 with justification 'Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement'\",\n    \"SOP: Pricing exceptions are scoped to the product and dates they name\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review is required. The request relies on the Acme Master Supply Agreement, but that agreement does not establish pricing eligibility for NS-EDGE. A pricing exception for NS-EDGE would require negotiation and formalization in the contract or as a new Schedule (similar to Schedule B for NS-500). Deal Desk must determine whether to extend special pricing to NS-EDGE and at what level.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Chief Revenue Officer\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25267,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25267},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"955b3fca-6a32-4628-a8b8-39c056f5efba","uuid":"65c5a081-7968-442b-8533-ab307e9caf17","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:22:26.270Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgWrqJcz4xJAy1nwtRA"}
